== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that follows Isaac around and collects {{E|Red Heart}}s. For every one-and-a-half Red Hearts collected, Dark Bum will generate one of the following:
** {{dlc|nr}} A single {{E|Soul Heart}}.
** {{dlc|r}} A single {{E|Black Heart}}.
** A hostile {{E|Spider}}.
** A friendly [[Blue Spider]].
** {{dlc|r}} A random [[pill]], [[Cards and Runes|card, or rune]].

