== Notes ==
* If Dark Bum enters one of a set of {{r|Super Secret Room}}s which allow only certain types of hearts to generate in them, he will drop that type of heart instead of what he normally would.
** The one which only allows Red Hearts will cause Dark Bum to consume the Red Hearts on the floor only to generate yet more Red Hearts. Leading Dark Bum around the room to consume the Red Hearts and then leaving the room before he's able to generate anything will avoid this.
* {{dlc+|a}} Dark Bum will only pick up regular Red Hearts ({{e|Half Red Heart}}s, {{e|Red Heart}}s, {{e|Double Heart}}s, {{e|Scared Heart}}s).{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Temporary hearts (such as from {{c|Tainted Magdalene}}, {{c|Tainted Eve}} with {{i|Birthright}}, etc.) can be collected by Dark Bum, which situationally may prove useful or dangerous.{{dlc-|r}}
* This item is very beneficial for characters that can't have [[Red Heart container]]s ({{c|???}}, {{c|Tainted ???}}, {{c|Black Judas}}, {{c|Tainted Judas}}, {{c|Tainted Forgotten}}) since they have no use for Red Hearts.
** Alternatively, characters that can't obtain Soul Hearts or Black Hearts for health may gain very little to no advantage from Dark Bum or may even be harmed if they're unable to pick up the Red Hearts before the Bum consumes them.
* {{c|Keeper}} and {{c|Tainted Keeper}} generally have no use for the Dark Bum since all hearts are converted to [[Blue Fly|Blue Flies]].
** This is averted if Keeper is in a [[co-op]] party with other characters that can utilize hearts.
** Dark Bum may also be picked up by Keeper for the potential transformation.
* {{dlc+|a+}} {{e|Scared Heart}}s will run away from Dark Bum. Pinching them between Dark Bum and Isaac or walls/corners will make them easier for the Bum to collect. {{dlc-|a+}}
* {{dlc|anr}} From a scoring perspective, hearts that Dark Bum picks up count towards your Schwag bonus on daily runs.
* Dark Bum does not join the line of familiars that follow behind Isaac.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Humbleing Bundle}} / {{t|Equality!|a+nr+}}: Most Red Heart drops will become Double Red Heart drops. This counts as two full Red Hearts for Dark Bum, essentially doubling the value of it.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: No effect, but familiar is bigger.
* {{i|Dark Bum}} / {{i|Cambion Conception}}: Each Dark Bum tracks the collected hearts separately.
* {{i|Options?}}: If one of the options is a Red Heart variant, Dark Bum may collect it, making the other option disappear.
* {{dlc+|r}} {{C|Tainted Cain}} / {{i|Bag of Crafting}}: The black hearts given by Dark Bum can make it easier to craft [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room items]].

